vijaya viṭhṭhala aka |","ḻaṃkana bhajisuvudu hṛdayadali tiḻidu ||1||"],["maṭṭa tāḻa","kari aja ratha vīthi èṃdèṃbuvè mūru |","barèdu idakè hannèraḍu rāśigaḻu vi- |","staravāgi uṃṭu èraḍèraḍu vòṃdu kaḍè |","arivadu sthimita samagati tvaragati sūryanna |","èraḍu nālaku koṇè viracisi adara melè |","maraḻè madhu – mādhavā karèsuva ṛtu òṃdu |","barèdu praṇava vivara hṛdayadalli nama |","skarisu jñānātmanèṃdu |","dharisu ī pari mūru èraḍu koṇiya madhya |","taruvāya māsa – ṛtu varuṣa tāraka saṃ |","smarisi krama varṇa hari aiśvaryādi |","parama mūrtigaḻannu śirasu mòdalu māḍi |","karataḻa padatanaka caritèyākòṃḍāḍu |","gurutu āru koṇè sari uparibhāga |","èraḍara madhya varaṇaṃgaḻu uṃṭu |","arahuvè prathamadalli èraḍèraḍu nālku 1. – “a,ā,ka,kha,ḍa,ḍha,ma,ya” |","2. èraḍènèya maniyalli varaṇagaḻippavayya |","“i,ī,u,ū,ga,gha,ṇa,ta,ra,la” |","3. smarisu mūranè maniyallirutippa mātra “ṛ,ṝ,lṛ,lṝ,ṅa,ca,tha,da,va,śa” |","4. karisikòṃḍavu initu nālkanè sthānadali","“è,ai,cha,ja,dha,na,ṣa,sa” |","5. varaṇaṃgaḻu grahisu aidanè maniyalli |","“o,au,jha,ña,pa,pha,ha,ḻa” |","6. niruta ippadu keḻi kaḍiyaṇa maniyalli |","“aṃ,aḥ,ṭa,ṭha,ba,bha,kṣa” barèdu ī pariyalli ārumaniya madhya |","sari illigè ènni taruvāya nālku |","èraḍū valayākāra èraḍu koṇiya gaṇita |","nirīkṣisi manadalli pariśuddhanāgi |","paramapuruṣa namma vijayaviṭhṭhala mūrtiya |","smarisu ajyādigaḻa narasiṃha pariyaṃta ||2||"],["rūpaka tāḻa"],["āru koṇiya melè vartuḻākāravannu |","cāruvāgi barèdu adara suttalu èṃṭu |","vārija daḻavannu racisi ramyavāgi |","sauri svarbhānu guru budha śukra caṃdrama |","dhāruṇisuta ketu ivaranna madhya |","hāraisi barèdu ivarivara baḻḻiyalli oṃ-|","kāra sahitavāgi namonārāyaṇanèṃbò |","īrèraḍu nālku varṇagaḻu oṃdòṃdaralli |","ārādhisi barèdu bījākṣaravènnu |","sāravannu tiḻi èṃṭu varṇamiḻita |","tāramaṃtravè satya idara niyāmaka viśva |","mūruti mòdalāda aṣṭa rūpaṃgaḻuṃṭu |","sauri rāhu madhya ādi varṇavè lipisi |","dviraṣṭa mātrā vargava idakè iṃdirā |","māruta devanna barèdu śruti kālagaḻa |